    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d998">

                <pb facs="0760" n="644" xml:id="pg644"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 703.3212/5a.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                            Brazilian Minister to Mexico.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-04-30">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">April 30, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your telegram of today<anchor n="81" xml:id="d998-f1"/> has been communicated to
                    us by the Brazilian Ambassador, Glad to know that you are now in charge of the
                    records, archives, etc. Please assure the British Legation of our appreciation
                    of their courtesies and the valuable service rendered by them during the time
                    they acted for us.</p>
                <p>You are authorized to comply with the request of the Minister for Foreign Affairs
                    that you deliver over the arms remaining in the Embassy to the police
                    authorities.</p>
                <p>It might be well for the present for you to send a brief telegram every night
                    before retiring, giving us the general situation there, so that we may be able
                    to answer questions that are asked us each morning.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">W. J. Bryan</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
